  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the DFID Match Fund 1 WASH and Sanitation Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the DFID Match Fund I Water and Gender programme, 3 Bangladeshi partners have been supported in their WASH and gender projects to support poor women, men and children. CAFOD is working with Caritas Bangladesh and ADD with technical support from ITN/BUET.  As the contract holder, CAFOD is responsible for monitoring and evaluating project progress. As part of this process a Mid-Term Review was commissioned. The projects are now ending and CAFOD is recruiting a Consultant to conduct a final evaluation of the projects.</narrative>
  </description>
